-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Performs comparison operations on <span class=\"t-lc\">std::expected</span> objects.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Compares two <span class=\"t-lc\">std::expected</span> objects. The objects compare equal if and only if both <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> contain expected values that are equal, or both contain unexpected values that are equal.\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-until-cxx26\"><td>\n<p>If any of the following expressions is ill-formed, or its result is not convertible to <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>, the program is ill-formed:\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx26\">(until C++26)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx26\"><td>\n<p>This overload participates in overload resolution only if all following expressions is well-formed, and their results are convertible to <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>:\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<ul><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>lhs <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>rhs</span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">error</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">error</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Compares <span class=\"t-lc\">std::expected</span> object with an <span class=\"t-lc\"><a hre